{"success":true,"count":21,"data":[{"id":"LppXloSh8eAjCFYSwPun","title":" NTTF Community Hub Admin ","desc":"NTTF Community Hub is a modern web-based communication and project management platform designed for the NTTF community. It enables students, parents, teachers, and administrators to stay connected through a single digital platform. Parents can communicate with teachers, receive important announcements, and monitor academic activities, while teachers can share updates, manage student information, and interact with parents efficiently. The platform also includes a secure admin dashboard for managing projects, portfolios, announcements, and community content. Built with HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and Firebase, it provides a responsive, secure, and user-friendly experience across all devices.","category":"web","image":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","live":"https://nttf-app-for-iphone.netlify.app/","code":"#","date":"2026-07-27","tech":["HTML","CSS","JS","BOOTSRAP","Firebase"]},{"id":"yi5oCfeJXMCCXoo4j67n","title":"DocuChat | AI PDF Analyzer","desc":"A responsive, client-side web application that allows users to upload PDF documents and extract text locally using PDF.js. It integrates with the Gemini 2.5 Flash API to provide an interactive, AI-powered chat interface where users can ask questions about the uploaded document's contents. Features include a modern glassmorphism design, a mobile-friendly slide-out sidebar, chat history export, and full Markdown rendering for AI responses.","category":"ai","image":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","live":"https://docu-chat-ai-ivory.vercel.app/","code":"https://github.com/MASTER870-CMD/DocuChat-AI","date":"2026-04-05","tech":["HTML","CSS","JavaScript","PDF.js","Marked.js","Gemini API"]},{"id":"KyHM9r5l0ANoJTkAC3Zg","title":"NexStock-Unified","desc":"a unified media engine designed to bridge the gap between stock asset discovery and creative editing. It aggregates high-resolution footage and photography from global repositories while prov